      <div class="policy-review"><strong>Development review — complete terms pending approval</strong><p>The prior WordPress export contains an unpublished terms draft for an older property. We have not adopted it. Before the public launch, Ron must approve the business identity, payment-plan conditions, course access rules, cancellation and refund terms, and the final checkout language.</p></div>

      <h2>The course on offer</h2>
      <p>The current HVAC Boot Camp has 27 modules and is delivered on the existing Moodle course site. It combines required textbook reading, Ron’s video instruction, and quizzes. The textbook, <em>Residential Construction Academy HVAC, 2nd Edition</em> by Eugene Silberstein, is purchased separately from the course.</p>

      <h2>Payment options shown on this site</h2>
      <ul><li>Pay in full: $479 for the course.</li><li>Monthly option: $97 today plus six payments of $97, or $679 total.</li></ul>
      <p>Both options are for the same existing course. Review the actual checkout before submitting a payment. The final payment-plan and course-access terms require business approval and testing at the existing checkout.</p>

      <h2>What the course can and cannot promise</h2>
      <p>Boot Camp teaches HVAC fundamentals online. It does not itself guarantee a job, grant a professional license or certification, or replace supervised field training and safe work practices.</p>

      <h2>Questions before paying</h2>
